@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra trang thai dich vu
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop hop le (status = received) -> 201 Created
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245180013",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Huyenxinh/RealtimeSubmissionSystem"
}

### 4. Doc lai trang thai luot nop: received -> processing -> graded (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Tao luot nop thieu du lieu -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. Tao luot nop cho bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245180013",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Huyenxinh/RealtimeSubmissionSystem"
}

### 7. Doc luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay SignalR negotiate -> 200 OK
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan hub (thieu s) -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. Bai tap 2: Nop repo khong bat dau bang https:// -> cham failed
# @name createFailedSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245180013",
  "repositoryUrl": "http://insecure-repo.com/dtc245180013"
}

### 11. Doc lai luot nop cham loi: received -> processing -> failed
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createFailedSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
